From 8c3728327c63723224bc402cfada580866b6d50c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian <claude@schlueternetz.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:31:30 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Fix security advisories: rubyzip, addressable, nokogiri

- rubyzip 2.4.1 -> 3.7.0 (GHSA-47m2-wp7j-p9vc / CVE-2026-85396, high:
  path traversal in Zip::Entry#extract). Requires github-pages 233, whose
  jekyll-remote-theme 0.6.2 allows rubyzip < 4 (0.4.3 capped it at < 3,
  which is why Dependabot could not open a fix PR).
- addressable 2.9.0 -> 2.9.2 (7 advisories published 2026-10-30)
- nokogiri 1.19.4 -> 1.19.7 (3 advisories published 2026-11-02)
- github-pages 232 -> 233 (also bumps jekyll-feed, jekyll-redirect-from,
  jekyll-seo-tag; adds openssl gem via jekyll-remote-theme)
- dependabot.yml: ecosystem was "pip"; this is a Ruby/bundler repo

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PkYA4epbrfXTF2feQHqZaG
---
 .github/dependabot.yml |  2 +-
 Gemfile                |  2 +-
 Gemfile.lock           | 34 ++++++++++++++++++----------------
 3 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/dependabot.yml b/.github/dependabot.yml
index 9d866e3..ff23ae4 100644
--- a/.github/dependabot.yml
+++ b/.github/dependabot.yml
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
 
 version: 2
 updates:
-  - package-ecosystem: "pip" # See documentation for possible values
+  - package-ecosystem: "bundler"
     directory: "/" # Location of package manifests
     schedule:
       interval: "weekly"
diff --git a/Gemfile b/Gemfile
index 6cd1a28..92e45f3 100644
--- a/Gemfile
+++ b/Gemfile
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@ gem "minima", "~> 2.5"
 # If you want to use GitHub Pages, remove the "gem "jekyll"" above and
 # uncomment the line below. To upgrade, run `bundle update github-pages`.
 # gem "github-pages", group: :jekyll_plugins
-gem "github-pages", "~> 232", group: :jekyll_plugins
+gem "github-pages", "~> 233", group: :jekyll_plugins
 
 # If you have any plugins, put them here!
 group :jekyll_plugins do
